\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   While shepherds watched their flocks by night,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj   All seated on the ground,
\par   The angel of the Lord came down,
\par   And glory shone around.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Fear not! Said he; for mighty dread
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  Had seized their troubled mind:
\par  Glad tidings of great joy I bring
\par   To you and all mankind.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  To you, in David's town, this day
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj   Is born, of David's line,
\par   A Saviour, who is Christ the Lord;
\par  And this shall be the sign:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  The heavenly Babe you there 
\par      shall find
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj   To human view displayed,
\par   All meanly wrapped in swaddling bands
\par    And in a manger laid.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Thus spake the seraph; and forthwith
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj   Appeared a shining throng
\par   Of angels praising God, and thus
\par   Addressed their joyful song:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. All glory be to God on high,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj   And to the earth be peace;
\par  Goodwill henceforth 
\par  from heaven to men
\par  Begin and never cease! Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

